<title>UK: UK GIVES NOD TO GRANADA BUY OF YORKSHIRE.</title>
<headline>UK GIVES NOD TO GRANADA BUY OF YORKSHIRE.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The UK Department for Trade and Industry said on Monday it had decided not to refer the proposed acquisition of Yorkshire-Tyne Tees Television Holdings Plc by Granada Group Plc to the Monopolies and Mergers Commission.</p>
<p>Hotels and media group Granada bid 680 million stg for Yorkshire and took majority control of the firm in July.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
</text>
